out/

# Python cache files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
samloader.log

# MacOS files
*.DS_Store

# WSL files
*.Identifier

# Cert
security/eternityrom_platform.x509.pem
security/eternityrom_platform.pk8
# Impulse ROM signing material. The .pk8 is the private platform key: losing
# it means no future build can ever sign an in-place update for devices
# already running Impulse. Committing it means anyone can. Back it up
# offline, never here. The cert is ignored alongside it so that a checkout
# without the key falls back to the aosp prefix instead of embedding an
# Impulse cert it cannot actually sign with.
security/impulse_platform.x509.pem
security/impulse_platform.pk8

# Defense in depth: catch any signing/credential material that ends up
# somewhere other than security/ by mistake. This is a safety net, not a
# substitute for keeping real keys out of the working tree entirely.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*.env

# Internal release-tracking note: quotes third-party XDA forum content and
# must not be published in the public source repo.
docs/RELEASE_WORK_20260919.md

# Personal editor config, not project policy.
.vscode/

#
# We don't want to ignore the following even if they are dot-files
#
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore
!.gitmodules
